stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Lock
    Lock --> Finished : no visible notes, nothing changed
    Lock --> Failed : a root tree is over the batch window
    Lock --> AskScope : tag focus, and all or the part that fits
    AskScope --> Finished : Cancel, nothing changed
    AskScope --> FirstBatch : existing, new, or both
    FirstBatch --> OtherBatches : new tags from batch 1 shared with the rest, up to 4 at once
    FirstBatch --> Failed : still invalid after 3 corrections, nothing applied
    OtherBatches --> Failed : a batch still invalid after 3 corrections, nothing applied
    OtherBatches --> Apply : all batches valid
    Apply --> Finished : one transaction, cannot be cancelled
    Finished --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
